                                                                                
 Usage: opentide setup platforms [OPTIONS] [path]                               
                                                                                
 Create and enable platform configuration files in                              
 `.opentide/configurations/platforms/`.                                         
                                                                                
╭─ Options ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╮
│ --path                   -C      <str>  Repository path [default: .]         │
│ --sentinel                              Enable Microsoft Sentinel            │
│ --splunk                                Enable Splunk Enterprise Security    │
│ --crowdstrike                           Enable CrowdStrike Falcon            │
│ --defender-for-endpoint                 Enable Microsoft Defender for        │
│                                         Endpoint                             │
│ --sentinel-one                          Enable SentinelOne                   │
│ --carbon-black-cloud                    Enable Carbon Black Cloud            │
│ --harfanglab                            Enable HarfangLab                    │
│ --elastic                               Enable Elastic Security              │
│ --sysdig                                Enable Sysdig Secure (Falco)         │
│ --plan                                  List the files each step would       │
│                                         write, and write nothing             │
│ --yes                    -y             Write without asking for             │
│                                         confirmation                         │
│ --help                                  Show this message and exit.          │
╰──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╯

 Examples
   $ opentide setup platforms --sentinel --splunk --yes
